lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# `dist/*`, not `dist`: git does not descend into an ignored directory, so
# ignoring `dist` itself would make the .gitkeep negation below dead. The
# placeholder is committed so `//go:embed all:web/dist` in embed.go always
# resolves — a binary built without an SPA then serves an explanatory 503
# instead of failing to compile. Vite empties dist/ on every build, so the
# committed copy is sourced from public/.gitkeep, which vite copies back into
# dist/ — keeping `git status` clean after builds. See AGENTS.md.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
dist-server
dist-ssr
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
